OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-drone measures to be deployed
OL,4,Aat Hull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FEquipment will be used to try and stop
OL,7,Fdrones from flying over Hull Fair
OL,8,Fwithout permission, Humberside Police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe force said a temporary airspace
OL,12,Frestriction will be in place over the
OL,13,FWalton Street site and surrounding area
OL,14,Fwhen the event starts next month.
OL,16,FCh Insp Derek Hussain said "counter
OL,17,Fdrone equipment" would allow police "to
OL,18,Fdetect drones and locate the people
OL,19,Fflying them".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
