OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-drone measures to be deployed
OL,4,Aat Hull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added: "There is no specific threat
OL,7,Fto the fair, but we will be prepared
OL,8,Ffor any eventuality."
